{"tool_name":"channel-montage","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<blockquote>\n<p>View your multi-channel data as a montage with one image per channel plus a merged, color channel (useful to create figures for communication).&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>This viewer plugin will split all N channels of the active sequence into a montage of N+1 images, with one image for each channel, plus an additionnal color (merge) rendering.</p>\n</blockquote>","summary":"","value":"<blockquote>\r\n<p>View your multi-channel data as a montage with one image per channel plus a merged, color channel (useful to create figures for communication).&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This viewer plugin will split all N channels of the active sequence into a montage of N+1 images, with one image for each channel, plus an additionnal color (merge) rendering.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-04-29T20:05:04+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2013-10-11T13:08:46+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505208998,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Dufour, Alexandre "}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":19,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"a8a58b02-2abc-4749-8aea-b9a6e7086874","url":"/user/19"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4184,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2409","url":"/data-handling"},{"target_id":4041,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Image_visualisation","url":"/image-visualisation"}],"has_implementation":[{"target_id":4340,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"6077b127-35d6-45a8-ac32-b321e9bd18f2","url":"